From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:02:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: panel: novatek,nt36523: Add Lenovo
 Legion Y700 (2025) panels

The Lenovo Legion Y700 (2025) / TB321FU uses a 1600x2560 NT36523 panel
from either BOE or CSOT, driven over two C-PHY DSI links with DSC.
Document a compatible for each of them.

The panel on that board also has its analog and core supplies on
regulators of their own, so document them as the optional vci and vdd
supplies.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
 .../bindings/display/panel/novatek,nt36523.yaml           | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/novatek,nt36523.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/novatek,nt36523.yaml
index b9300a1f2..c9d106a1c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/novatek,nt36523.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/novatek,nt36523.yaml
@@ -19,6 +19,8 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - lenovo,tb321fu-boe-nt36523
+              - lenovo,tb321fu-csot-nt36523
               - xiaomi,elish-boe-nt36523
               - xiaomi,elish-csot-nt36523
           - const: novatek,nt36523
@@ -37,6 +39,12 @@ properties:
   vddio-supply:
     description: regulator that supplies the I/O voltage
 
+  vci-supply:
+    description: regulator that supplies the analog voltage
+
+  vdd-supply:
+    description: regulator that supplies the core voltage
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
-- 
